{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11111240","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11111240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1111124001:1":{"text":"내가... 내가 지다니?!!","source_cn":"我——我怎么可能输？！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABD49ED97940F5D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111124002:1":{"text":"사막의 발톱의 왕인 내가 이렇게 오합지졸에 무능하고 멍청하기 그지없는 녀석들한테 졌다고?!","source_cn":"流沙之爪的王，输在颓废的、无能的、愚蠢的手下败将和一群...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B12F61DDCD43573","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111124003:1":{"text":"똑똑히 봐, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(와)과 소렌은 오합지졸이 아니야.","source_cn":"睁开眼睛认清楚，<style=stress><play...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3C2CACD1434AB7B2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"똑똑히 봐, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(와)과 소렌은 오합지졸이 아니야.","female":"똑똑히 봐, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(와)과 소렌은 오합지졸이 아니야.","variant_male_record_index":"123409","variant_female_record_index":"123410","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111124004:1":{"text":"계속 지껄여 봐, 프랭크. 와이어트가 사막의 발톱이었던 게 뭐가 어때서?","source_cn":"继续把话说完，弗兰克。怀亚特曾经是流沙之爪的人，又怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A66FC74911D793A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111124005:1":{"text":"녀석은 재빠르고 아주 강했어. 진정한 현상금 사냥꾼이 탐낼만한 황금 같은 따뜻한 마음씨도 가지고 있었지!","source_cn":"他对气泡水的品味很好，行动也敏捷。他深埋在心中的善意，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5F3CB3B3A8CA8E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111124006:1":{"text":"사막의 발톱한테서 벗어난 뒤로 와이어트는 더 이상 너희와 한패가 아니었다고!","source_cn":"从说想脱离流沙之爪之后，怀亚特就不再是你们的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C2EF341CFAE34CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111124007:1":{"text":"그 자식은... 네 영향을 너무 많이 받았어. 심지어 인간들과 어울려서 소꿉장난하는 게 제대로 된 삶이라고 생각하기까지 했다고!","source_cn":"那个小混蛋……他受你影响太多了，竟然觉得和人类混在一起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4BDCBF44D6D8720","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111124008:1":{"text":"결국엔 네놈을 대동하고 나를 치러 왔었지... 뻔뻔한 배신자 자식! 놈은 내 손에 죽어 마땅했어. 그 악어가죽을 벗겨서 부츠로 만들었어야 했는데!","source_cn":"最后竟然还领你来袭击我……无耻的叛徒，他就应该葬身在我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0C735A26E048A81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111124009:1":{"text":"오늘 죽을 사람은 따로 있지.","source_cn":"今天要葬身的另有其人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC19D85FC4848EA78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111124010:1":{"text":"덤벼. 결투 규칙대로... 너와 나, 단판 승부다.","source_cn":"来吧，按决斗的规矩——只有你我。单挑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BB059856E10F35D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111124011:1":{"text":"닥쳐, 닥쳐, 닥쳐! 사막의 발톱의 왕은 절대로 네놈 손에 지지 않아!!","source_cn":"闭嘴、闭嘴、闭嘴！流沙之爪的王绝不会输在你手上！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCDFBD2F3AB0311D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:弗兰克":{"text":"프랭크","source":"弗兰克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦尔克":{"text":"워커","source":"瓦尔克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":2}}